      "body": "## 项目自荐：Build a Hooper\n\n  大家好，我做了一个篮球主题的网页小游戏：[Build a Hooper](https://buildahooper.app/)。\n\n  它的玩法是：你可以通过 13 轮选秀，从不同历史球队中抽取传奇球员，并从每位球员身上“偷取”一项能力，最终组合成一个属于自己的篮球运动员。完成构建后，系统会模拟一个 82 场赛季，生成战绩、比赛直播、赛季排名，并支持提交排行榜和分享结果。\n\n  项目地址：[https://buildahooper.app/](https://buildahooper.app/)\n\n  主要功能：\n\n  - 从历史球队中随机抽取球员\n  - 为自定义球员组合 13 项篮球能力\n  - 模拟完整 82 场赛季\n  - 查看单场比赛直播过程\n  - 提交赛季成绩到排行榜\n  - 生成并分享自己的球员结果\n\n  这个项目主要面向喜欢篮球、NBA 历史球员和模拟经营玩法的用户。它不是严肃的数据分析工具，更像是一个轻量的篮球幻想模拟器：如果你把不同年代球星的能力组合到一个人身上，这名球员能打出怎样的赛季？\n\n  项目是独立粉丝作品，不隶属于 NBA 或 NBA 2K。\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Project Recommendation: Build a Hooper\n\n  Hi, I built a basketball-themed web game called [Build a Hooper](https://buildahooper.app/).\n\n  The idea is simple: build your dream basketball player by going through 13 draft rounds. In each round, you spin a historic team, pick a\n  legendary player, and steal one skill from that player. Once your custom hooper is complete, the site simulates an 82-game season with\n  records, live game logs, standings, leaderboard submission, and shareable results.\n\n  Project link: [https://buildahooper.app/](https://buildahooper.app/)\n\n  Main features:\n\n  - Spin historic teams and draft legendary players\n  - Combine 13 skills into one custom player\n  - Simulate a full 82-game season\n  - Watch live-style play-by-play game logs\n  - Submit your season record to the leaderboard\n  - Share your final build and result\n\n  The project is for basketball fans who enjoy player-building, NBA history, and lightweight simulation games. It is not a serious\n  analytics product, but more of a fantasy basketball simulator: what kind of season would your custom player have if you could combine\n  skills from different legends?\n\n  This is an independent fan project and is not affiliated with the NBA or NBA 2K.",
